<title>GERMANY: TABLE-AVA H1 group pre-tax profit rises.</title>
<headline>TABLE-AVA H1 group pre-tax profit rises.</headline>
<dateline>BIELEFELD, Germany 1997-08-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to the end of June 1997</p>
<p>(in millions of marks unless stated)</p>
<p>    Group pre-tax profit		     24.3    vs 22</p>
<p>    Group sales (excluding Nanz unit)    4,900   up 12.2 pct</p>
<p>NOTE - Full name of the German retail group is AVA Allgemeine Handelsgesellschaft der Verbraucher AG. The group said that sales at the Nanz unit grew 4.4 percent to 1.1 billion marks in the period. AVA holds 49.9 percent of Nanz. The group said that it was confident that 1997 full-year earnings would match those of 1996. Group net profit in 1996 was 28.6 million marks.</p>
<p>-- Frankfurt Newsroom +49 69 756525</p>
</text>
